<title>USA: Triad Systems Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Triad Systems Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERMORE, Calif. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triad Systems Corporation</p>
<p>			 Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>		For the Three Month Periods Ended December 31</p>
<p>(Amounts in thousands</p>
<p> except per share data)		    1996	     1995</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p>     Automotive			    $22,998	 $23,810</p>
